# Pollinations App Key (publishable, pk_...) — powers "Sign in with Pollinations"
# and the Live Forge mode (BYOP: players spend their own Pollen).
#
# 1. Go to https://enter.pollinations.ai/keys -> "Create New App Key"
# 2. Name it (shows on the consent screen), e.g. "Real or AI?"
# 3. Add a Redirect URI matching your deployment exactly, e.g.
#      https://your-app.vercel.app/
#    (local dev: http://localhost:3000/ — loopback matches any port)
# 4. Paste the pk_... key here and redeploy.
#
# Without this key the game still works 100% as a guest (pre-baked fakes).
NEXT_PUBLIC_POLLINATIONS_APP_KEY=

# (optional) Owner API key used ONLY by the build-time regeneration script
# `bun run content:regen` — never shipped to the browser.
# POLLINATIONS_API_KEY=sk_...
